    <bpmn:task id="task_6afat8dw" name="World gen core + chunk streaming" dai:notes="world/rng.ts (hash32 + mulberry32), noise.ts (seeded simplex), terrain.ts: warped continental fBm + masked ridged mountains + soft terraces, airfield search &#38; flattening, biome vertex colours (sea depth bands, foam, sand, meadow, Voronoi farmland, forest, rock, snow). Checked: ~65-70% land, heights -185..740 m, airfields placed in ~10 ms, 0.5 µs per height sample." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_ohjh4os8">
