    <bpmn:task id="task_2r48sc2i" name="Hangar screen &#38; preview" dai:notes="ui/hangar.ts + index.html/style.css: Hangar panel on the right of the title screen with Plane / Paint / Engine / Wheels tabs, option cards (icon, name, trait), 8 paint swatches, loadout name line, 5 stat bars (Top speed, Climb, Handling, Short takeoff, Easy landing) from loadoutStats() with animated +/- deltas. Keyboard ←/→/↑/↓ (and WASD), gamepad bumpers/d-pad, Enter / A to fly. Saved on every change. game.ts: preview Plane on the home apron in front of the hangar doors, slow turntable, drag to rotate, camera framed per airframe size, engine idles quietly once audio is unlocked by a click. Sortie uses the loadout: composed spec (same object, so ?debug tuning still works), per-airframe gear, cockpit eye point and chase distance, hints with the computed rotation speed, landing grade thresholds scaled by tyre crash speed, debrief &#39;Aircraft&#39; row. Checked in Chrome: all 17 cards build with no errors; ?plane= works; panels leave the centre free at 1440 px." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_1zwngb8u">
