    <bpmn:task id="task_z0wf3alz" name="Engine audio &#38; HUD per type" dai:notes="audio.ts: setEngine(); prop = pulsing putt (as before), turbo = buzzier saw + turbine whine, jet = low rumble + filtered noise roar + rising whistle; update() takes a gain for the quiet hangar idle. hud.ts: throttle readout shows &#39;spool %&#39; for the jet and higher RPM for the turbo. Not verified by ear (no audio in the automated browser)." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_dvofzdw4">
