    <bpmn:task id="task_pjdrvauj" name="Engine comes with the plane" dai:notes="loadout.ts: Loadout is now { style, paint, wheels }; AirframeDef.engine (biplane prop, turboprop turbo, jet jet) and one engineMount; removed ENGINES, jetExhaust, maxPropRadius, propRadius(); engineOf(style). Turbo prop radius 1.15 (same clearance as before). parseLoadout accepts style.paint.wheels and old style.paint.engine.wheels links; saved loadouts with an engine key are sanitised. planeMesh.ts: one engine path per style (turboprop exhaust stacks moved into its body; single jet flame at the nozzle); jet-pod and nose-prop variants deleted. Hangar has Plane / Paint / Wheels tabs; plane cards name their engine. Audio, HUD and hints use engineOf(style). Tests 25/25 (9 flight combos), tsc OK. Chrome: tabs Plane/Paint/Wheels, each style builds the right engine, legacy ?plane= link works, sortie spawns on asphalt, no errors. design.dai: Engine feature and &#39;Odd combos&#39; risk removed, style/model/composer/ADR/rule/save/test updated." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_snxp38pz">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_clo6m0kr</bpmn:incoming>
