    <bpmn:task id="task_4ihayk5l" name="Menu stays put in Free flight" dai:notes="style.css: in Free flight the flight plan is visibility: hidden instead of display: none, so it keeps its place and the menu stays where it is in Cross-country. Under 1040 px wide (where the two panels stack) it is still display: none, so phones don&#39;t get an empty block. Checked in Chrome at 1440 px: menu at 226,112 (480×592) in both modes; the hidden plan doesn&#39;t catch clicks." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_pq6dy1dp</bpmn:incoming>
